# This mod ships no assembly and has nothing to build, so this file is short. Two separate
# reasons to have it, and only the first is about git:
#
#   - Until 2026-09-11 this folder sat in a monorepo whose .gitignore covered all of this. That
#     file did not travel with the folder, and now there is nothing above this one to inherit
#     from at all.
#   - Steam does not read .gitignore at all. SteamUGC.SetItemContent takes the junction's target
#     directory as it stands on disk, with no filtering, so anything sitting in the published
#     folder is published. That is what Mod/ is for: the junction points there, and everything
#     else in this folder - Art/, the docs, this file - stays out of reach by construction.

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings. A session creates its worktree in the current
# directory, so sometimes inside this one, and each is a full copy of the repository.
.claude/

# Showcase notes: French working notes, deleted once Preview.png is done.
PROMPT_*.md

# Development environments.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.csproj.user

# System.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

